---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = '404 - 页面未找到 | VPNWorld';
const description = '抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移除。';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="container-custom py-20 text-center">
    <div class="text-6xl font-black text-blue-600 mb-4">404</div>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">页面未找到</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 max-w-md mx-auto mb-8">
      抱歉，您请求的链接可能已被移动、更名或暂时下线。请返回首页或通过导航重新寻找。
    </p>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="btn-brand-primary text-sm px-6 py-2.5">返回首页</a>
      <a href="/ranking/overall/" class="btn-brand-secondary text-sm px-5 py-2.5">查看排行榜</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
